<img src="tammi-advocacy.jpg"
     alt="Tammi Wooten advocacy work"
     class="hero-photo">
.hero-photo{
    width:320px;
    max-width:90%;
    border-radius:30px;

    border:6px solid white;

    box-shadow:
    0 20px 50px rgba(0,0,0,.25);

    margin-bottom:30px;
}

<p class="photo-caption">

Advocating to end child marriage and protect children.

</p>
.photo-caption{
    font-size:1rem;
    opacity:.95;
    margin-bottom:20px;
}
<section class="featured-photo">

<h2 class="section-title">
Advocacy In Action
</h2>

<img src="tammi-advocacy.jpg"
     alt="Advocacy event"
     class="featured-image">

<p>
Using lived experience to raise awareness about child marriage,
support survivors, and advocate for stronger protections for children.
</p>

</section>
.featured-photo{
    text-align:center;
    background:white;
}

.featured-image{
    width:100%;
    max-width:700px;

    border-radius:25px;

    box-shadow:
    0 15px 40px rgba(0,0,0,.15);

    margin:25px auto;
}

